      {
        "id": 218734,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-06-11T20:06:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>*nods*&nbsp;</p><p>In amongst all the writing for my own company, freelancing for other game companies, and my day job, I also ghostwrite a monthly column in&nbsp;<em>Pet Age&nbsp;</em>for Reptiles by Mack, one of the largest reptile wholesalers in the United States.&nbsp; My wife used to work there and, even after she left for a different job, I've continued on writing the CEO's monthly column.</p><p>So, yeah...we know our way around some reptiles.&nbsp;</p>",
